 in the  future i think i'm gonna  gonna actively pursue that they were  nice enough to  uh tweet about my videos when i when i  did them so that's really cool  i have to say thank you for that um  what am i gonna do here for for the next  year  well i'm gonna shoot some i was gonna i  thought about shooting stoicism videos  having to do with the history of  stoicism for stoicism week  and then i realized nah you know in the  spring i'm planning on bringing out a  history of philosophy channel and i'd be  better off to put that stuff in there  so you know this spring or perhaps this  summer depending on how the production  schedule goes  you can look for some videos talking  about  the stoic school and its development you  know the early stowa middle still  late stoa neo stoicism in  in the christian era  and then in the renaissance and then in  early modernity  and all the way down to the present i'll  do a series on those and i'll do series  on other  um schools of philosophy as well but  i've got some wind in my sails for doing  the stoicism stuff  i'm also i've also decided i'm going to  develop i'm doing a lot of online  teaching  not just for marist college but also for  a plano  and for some other  organizations and platforms as well but  i think i'm going to in the next year  develop a 12-week online class  in stoicism a really serious  study of this bearing credit college  credit  and um yeah i'll i'll produce that it'll  be for  for a plano um if there's other  platforms that are interested maybe i'll  see about  about doing it for them as well because  i think there's enough  interest out there on the part of the  the public  to have a college class on this so i'll  be doing that  um i'm going to do some online shorter  courses  in some of the other platforms that i  work with  i can put links to that or you can find  those by looking me up on my  you know various online presences and  then  i want to start thinking about what to  do  next year we were a 